WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.500
HIPAA training. Module 11. Lab: billing, insurance and records work.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:13.533
Payment work is allowed, but only for the minimum information each step needs.

3
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.067
Export only the columns the review needs.

4
00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:21.633
Share only what the eligibility check needs.

5
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:25.000
Do not export every field to save time.

6
00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:29.067
Do not send the whole chart to answer a billing question.

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.033
The clinic holds the patient information.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.967
A collection agency is a business associate, so it needs a signed agreement.

9
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.400
Only then may it receive anything.

10
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.200
Recipient: who exactly?

11
00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:48.967
Destination: confirmed?

12
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.567
Content: only what the step needs.

13
00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:55.000
Channel: the approved one.

14
00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.433
Copies: none kept.

15
00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.167
Stop.

16
00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:00.567
Do not share.

17
00:01:00.967 --> 00:01:02.100
Ask your lead.

18
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.233
Now read the module.
